# PRIVACY POLICY
PRIVACY POLICY
PRIVACY POLICY

Effective Date: August 11, 2026

CAIA Analyst ("we", "us", or "our") operates the CAIA Analyst mobile application (the "App") designed to help users prepare for the Chartered Alternative Investment Analyst (CAIA) examinations.

This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use the App. By downloading and using the App, you agree to the practices described below.

1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

1.1 No Account Required. The App does not require you to create an account, register, or provide any personal information such as your name, email address, or phone number.

1.2 On-Device Data Only. The App stores all user data locally on your device. This includes:
  - Your study progress, quiz attempts, and scores;
  - Flashcard review schedules;
  - Your selected language preference;
  - Locally cached educational content used to improve offline performance.

This data is stored using your device's local storage and never leaves your device.

1.3 No Collection of Personal Data. We do not collect, transmit, or store personal data, location data, browsing history, contacts, or any content you create while using the App.

2. HOW WE USE INFORMATION

Because the App stores all data on your device, we do not use or process your data for any purpose other than providing the App's functionality. Data is used solely to:
  - Display your study progress and performance statistics;
  - Remember your preferences and settings;
  - Serve the educational content you select.

3. DATA SHARING AND DISCLOSURE

We do not sell, rent, trade, or share your personal information with any third party. Since the App operates without collecting or transmitting personal data, there is no information to disclose.

4. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

The App does not integrate advertising networks, analytics services, or third-party tracking tools. It does not communicate with external servers beyond downloading static educational content bundled with the App. Therefore, no third parties receive your data through the App.

5. DATA STORAGE AND SECURITY

All information is stored locally on your device. You may clear this data at any time by using the "Reset Data" option within the App's Settings screen or by clearing the App's data through your device's application settings.

6. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

The App is not directed to children under the age of 13 and does not knowingly collect any information from children.

7. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Effective Date" at the top of this document. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.

8. CONTACT US

If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: ivanng611@gmail.com
